// The first day of the week each locale counts from, LOCALE_IFIRSTDAYOFWEEK.
//
// Measured on Windows build 26200 25H2, 2026-10-15, through WeekdayName itself: WeekdayName(1, False, 0)
// names the day a locale counts from and WeekdayName(d, False, 1) names every day, so the two are matched
// up. VBScript numbers the days 1 for Sunday through 7 for Saturday, and these are the same numbers, so
// WeekdayName(w, b, 0) counts from the locale's own day while leaving the argument out counts from Sunday.
//
// Editing this by hand makes it something other than what Windows answers.

